---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Design Tokens" description="Complete reference for all Velora CSS custom properties.">
  <span class="vl-kicker">Reference</span>

  <h1 class="docs-page-title">Design Tokens</h1>
  <p class="docs-page-lead">
    CSS custom properties that power every Velora component. All tokens are prefixed <code>--vl-</code>
    and live in the <code>velora.tokens</code> layer.
  </p>

  <h2>Color System</h2>

  <h3>Brand Palette</h3>
  <p>Velora's brand uses a natural, earthy palette built on hex values for precision:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Token</th><th>Value</th><th>Swatch</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--vl-brand-stone</code></td>
        <td><code>#c8c9b0</code></td>
        <td><span class="docs-swatch docs-swatch--stone"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--vl-brand-olive</code></td>
        <td><code>#a9b08b</code></td>
        <td><span class="docs-swatch docs-swatch--olive"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--vl-brand-moss</code></td>
        <td><code>#7f8668</code></td>
        <td><span class="docs-swatch docs-swatch--moss"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--vl-brand-deep</code></td>
        <td><code>#5c604c</code></td>
        <td><span class="docs-swatch docs-swatch--deep"></span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Semantic Color Aliases</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Token</th><th>Maps to</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-primary</code></td><td><code>--vl-brand-moss</code></td><td>Primary interactive color</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-primary-soft</code></td><td>18% primary + transparent</td><td>Subtle fills and tints</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-secondary</code></td><td><code>--vl-brand-olive</code></td><td>Secondary accent</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-accent</code></td><td><code>--vl-brand-deep</code></td><td>Deep accent for contrast</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-success</code></td><td><code>#6f8661</code></td><td>Positive / success states</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-warning</code></td><td><code>#c1ab72</code></td><td>Warning states</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-color-danger</code></td><td><code>#8a5f50</code></td><td>Error / danger states</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Surface Tokens (theme-aware)</h3>
  <p>
    These change automatically based on light/dark mode. Set <code>data-theme</code> on the root element to override:
  </p>
  <pre><code>&lt;html data-theme="dark"&gt;   &lt;!-- Force dark --&gt;
&lt;html data-theme="light"&gt;  &lt;!-- Force light --&gt;
&lt;html&gt;                      &lt;!-- Follow OS preference --&gt;</code></pre>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Token</th><th>Light</th><th>Dark</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-bg-main</code></td><td><code>#e3e3cd</code></td><td><code>#232321</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-bg-surface</code></td><td><code>#f3f2e6</code></td><td><code>#2a2b25</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-bg-surface-elevated</code></td><td><code>#ecebd9</code></td><td><code>#32342d</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-bg-inset</code></td><td><code>#d7d8c0</code></td><td><code>#1a1a17</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-bg-overlay</code></td><td>oklch 96% / 0.8a</td><td>oklch 10% / 0.65a</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

