  <h3>Motion System Properties</h3>
  <p>These are used internally by the <code>vl-*</code> attribute system and can be overridden per-element:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Token</th><th>Default</th><th>Controls</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-motion-duration</code></td><td><code>--vl-duration-normal</code></td><td>Animation duration for current effect</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-motion-distance</code></td><td><code>1.25rem</code></td><td>Translation distance for slide/fade effects</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-motion-ease</code></td><td><code>--vl-ease-cinematic</code></td><td>Easing function for current effect</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--vl-stagger-step</code></td><td><code>45ms</code></td><td>Delay between staggered children</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <pre><code>&lt;!-- Override per element --&gt;
&lt;div
  vl-effect="fade-up"
  vl-timeline="view"
  style="--vl-motion-distance: 2rem; --vl-motion-duration: 600ms;"&gt;
  Custom depth and speed
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>

