  <h2>Theming</h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;!-- Follow OS preference (default) --&gt;
&lt;html&gt;

&lt;!-- Force light mode --&gt;
&lt;html data-theme="light"&gt;

&lt;!-- Force dark mode --&gt;
&lt;html data-theme="dark"&gt;

&lt;!-- Compact layout density --&gt;
&lt;html data-layout="compact"&gt;

&lt;!-- Presentation mode (larger spacing) --&gt;
&lt;html data-layout="presentation"&gt;</code></pre>
  <p>
    <code>data-layout="compact"</code> reduces base font size to 15px and tightens spacing.
    <code>data-layout="presentation"</code> increases to 17px with looser leading — ideal for projectors and keynotes.
  </p>
</Base>
